('Carrot', 'Daucus carota', 'VEGETABLE', 'Root vegetable grown for its sweet, crunchy taproot.',
    'FULL_SUN', 'Tolerates light afternoon shade in hot climates.', 4, 'Keep soil consistently moist to prevent forked or cracked roots.',
