('Bell Pepper', 'Capsicum annuum', 'VEGETABLE', 'Sweet, warm-season fruiting vegetable.',
    'FULL_SUN', 'Needs at least 6 hours of direct sun.', 3, 'Water deeply and consistently; irregular watering causes blossom end rot.',
