('Zucchini', 'Cucurbita pepo', 'VEGETABLE', 'Prolific summer squash.',
    'FULL_SUN', 'Needs 6+ hours of direct sun.', 3, 'Deep watering at the base; avoid wetting leaves to prevent powdery mildew.',
    'Rich, well-drained soil amended with compost.', 'Feed every 2-3 weeks once flowering begins.', 'Remove any yellowing leaves to improve airflow.',
    true, 45, 55, 'Harvest young, around 6-8 inches long, for the best texture and flavor.'),
('Cucumber', 'Cucumis sativus', 'VEGETABLE', 'Vining or bush warm-season vegetable.',
    'FULL_SUN', 'Needs 6+ hours of direct sun.', 2, 'Consistent moisture is key; irregular watering leads to bitter fruit.',
    'Rich, well-drained soil high in organic matter.', 'Feed every 2-3 weeks once vines start to run.', 'Train vining types up a trellis to save space and improve airflow.',
    true, 50, 70, 'Harvest when firm and green, before they start to yellow.'),
('Spinach', 'Spinacia oleracea', 'VEGETABLE', 'Cool-season leafy green.',
    'PARTIAL_SHADE', 'Prefers cool conditions; afternoon shade helps in warmer weather.', 3, 'Keep soil evenly moist.',
    'Rich, well-drained soil high in nitrogen.', 'Light feeding every 3 weeks.', 'None needed; harvest outer leaves to extend the picking period.',
    true, 40, 45, 'Harvest outer leaves once they reach 3-4 inches, or cut the whole plant at the base.'),
('Radish', 'Raphanus sativus', 'VEGETABLE', 'Fast-growing root vegetable, great for beginners.',
