    'Loose, well-drained soil free of large debris.', 'Minimal feeding needed; too much nitrogen favors leaves over roots.', 'Thin seedlings to about 1 inch apart.',
    true, 22, 30, 'Harvest as soon as roots reach 1 inch in diameter; they turn woody and pungent if left too long.'),

